Context Language Models
  Paper: arXiv 2609.37725. Research code:
  https://github.com/facebookresearch/context-language-models, licensed CC BY-NC 4.0.
  opencode-clm is not licensed under CC BY-NC and is not endorsed by its authors. A
  normalized 5-gram comparison of every model-facing string here against that
  repository found no shared span longer than 6 tokens (generic phrases and URLs).
  Two design choices follow its harness: the fit/shrink edit gate and the default
  25/50/75% reminder steps. pi-clm's skill guidance on edit cost (batch edits, mind the
  tail below an edit, write detailed summaries), carried into
  skills/clm-context/SKILL.md, covers the same points as the harness prompt in
  different words.
